    "PROPOSED_FIX": "FIX: In bench/dm/_manager.py, make `prefer_novelty` affect the stop decision inside `process_round()` by checking the health-monitor flag and substituting a novelty-based stop predicate.\n\n1) Replace the stop computation block in `process_round()`:\n\n<<<<\n        mu = self.diminishing_returns.marginal_value(round_idx) if round_idx in self.diminishing_returns._cumulative_yields else 0.0\n        is_diminished = self.diminishing_returns.stop(round_idx)\n====\n        mu = self.diminishing_returns.marginal_value(round_idx) if round_idx in self.diminishing_returns._cumulative_yields else 0.0\n        if getattr(self.health_monitor, \"_prefer_novelty_over_mu\", False):\n            is_diminished = (\n                round_idx >= self.config.r_min\n                and novelty < self.config.tau_novelty_stop\n            )\n        else:\n            is_diminished = self.diminishing_returns.stop(round_idx)\n>>>>\n\n2) Keep `_apply_transform()` as-is, because its flag now has a consumer.",
